00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.120
You fool!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.440
I already told you to hide, didn't I?

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:26.720
Crap!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.420
Getting distracted under these circumstances is not a wise move, you know.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.600
To lower your guard for an entire second...

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:36.640
Don't you forget Savate's Harijan Wrestling!

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:38.330
Bye bye!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.640
Sakaki-san!

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.080
Master Sakaki!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:52.000
For him to be concerned about the fate of this maggot...

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:52.960
Shio...

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:57.040
As I thought, you're really too soft to survive in this world.

