00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:28.160
You've got guts to hit me like that.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.000
Get away Kenichi-san!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.060
Serve!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.900
I'm going to take my time and enjoy killing you slowly.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.210
Receive!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.050
Stop that!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.800
You truly are a fine one,

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.610
<i>Mademoiselle.</i>

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:56.000
It'd be a waste to kill you here.

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.760
My bulletproof suit!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:08.170
I'm going to kill you after you get better.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:14.140
Until then, L'Obscurité will keep your alive.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:16.140
L'obscurite?

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.960
It's called "Yami" in this country, isn't it?

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:23.320
Why don't you tell me all about it while you're in chatty mood.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.680
What is that "Yami"?

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:27.980
That Fuurinji...

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:31.240
So he hasn't even told his own granddaughter yet...

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.040
About our existence...

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:40.980
"Yami", are agents who accepted the Satsujin style and embraced the essence of killing,

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.980
which is regarded as a taboo in martial arts world.

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:49.460
They're an organization directly opposite of the Katsujin style-wielding Ryouzanpaku.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:51.460
According to rumors,

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.920
the Japanese "Yami" have recently declared war on Ryouzanpaku or something.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:57.800
Was that the reason for all those recent actions?

00:20:57.800 --> 00:21:00.060
You'll soon understand everything.

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:01.060
Stop!

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.300
I'll give you money!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.320
<i>Kao Loi!</i>

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.320
TLC note: Muay Thai move that executes attacker's knee to the face.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.060
Ke-Kenichi-san!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:08.800
Hey, hey.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:12.120
Won’t you please let me kill you one by one now?

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.690
I told you to stop, didn't I?!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.420
You’re still alive boy?

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:18.380
Okay, fight on till the end!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:21.760
I'm going to pay whatever amount you want if you beat him.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:25.120
Kenichi-san doesn't need that kind of deal.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:26.130
What?

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:30.440
He'll pursue the right path even if it means risking his life.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:32.500
That's Kenichi-san's principle.

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:38.000
It's a powerful principle that enabled him to overcome the hellish training at Ryouzanpaku.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.280
Pri-Principle?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.720
You've got guts.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:43.020
I'm moved.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.940
I'll finish this in one blow then!

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:47.650
Get away!

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:49.380
You’re in the way.

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.460
Miu-san!

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:03.080
It's to disordered I can even dodge it with my eyes closed.

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:09.960
Nope, it'd be bad if you close your eyes now.

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:14.740
My clothes got wasted!

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:15.920
Sakaki-san!

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:18.880
Damn that Shio...

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:21.220
Surprise attacks are not fair!

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:22.160
You did it first!

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:23.680
You pulled a surprise attack on me earlier!

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.200
That was because you weren't paying attention!

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:26.660
How about you then?!

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:30.700
Master Sakaki...

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:34.240
You really are alive, right?!

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:36.960
You bastard...

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:38.480
Seems you did a lot of things

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:41.080
while I was gone...

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:42.240
Die!

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:44.420
I'm really mad now!

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.400
Relax both of you.

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:26.900
I might look angry, but I am actually calm.

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:29.720
A–Amazing...

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:32.300
So this is a real martial artist.

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:40.480
Souvenirs~

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:42.500
I already told you!

00:23:42.780 --> 00:23:43.990
I'm sorry about that.

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:46.580
We never thought he could move with that injury.

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:49.980
It's just been two days since Christopher escaped from the police hospital.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:52.160
We'll surely find him!

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:53.840
That's impossible.

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:56.740
There are a lot of big guys covering his back.

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:58.740
He's far far gone from the country already.

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:02.000
Also, about Gauche the weapons dealer...

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.400
He was supposed to go back to his country...

00:24:03.780 --> 00:24:04.900
Was he done for?

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:08.740
No... he seemed to have secluded himself and went on a trip.

00:24:10.020 --> 00:24:10.940
<i>"What's a person?"</i>

00:24:10.940 --> 00:24:12.460
<i>"What's a principle?"</i>

00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:17.580
With those last words, he donated all of his assets, and disappeared into the mountains.

00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:18.760
Principle...

00:24:19.260 --> 00:24:22.600
Sakaki, what kind of threat did you use on him?

00:24:22.900 --> 00:24:24.780
He changed totally as a human.

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:28.480
