00:24:33.580 --> 00:24:35.720
He's really growing more and more fearsome.

00:24:36.940 --> 00:24:39.260
A question that lingers inside every fighter.

00:24:40.280 --> 00:24:42.780
How strong are they really?

00:24:43.820 --> 00:24:47.540
